fixture tech10_jump_in_low_gap
doc BUILD.md s5 Ground "Crouch: Hitbox 44 to 28 tall; cannot move"; s5 tech 10; docs/adr/0010: the crouched box cannot move in the air either, so hopping under a low ceiling never crawls
room test/longgap
spawn 600 544
frames 60
input
  # A crouch-dash into the 384 u gap stops inside it.
  0..2 D
  3 D dash
  4..19 R
  # From rest, holding forward and hopping: there is no headroom to stand, so the body stays
  # crouched, and the stick does not move it.
  20 R jump
  21 R
  22 R jump
  23 R
  24 R jump
  25 R
  26 R jump
  27 R
  28 R jump
  29..59 R
end
expect
  at 19 crouch=1 vx=0
  during 20..59 crouch=1 height=28 vx=0 x=x@19
end
